  sequenceLabelId: ExchangeCamp_EN
  narrativeCategory: 1
  dialogueLines:
  - subtitleText: This area was the Exchange Camp, established in 1943. Jewish hostages
      were held here to be exchanged for interned Germans or foreign currency. But
      for over two thousand of them, it was just a brief reprieve before being murdered
      in Auschwitz.
